{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2708\ufe0f <strong>Fly modern fighter jets</strong><br>Unlock iconic 3rd-to-6th generation aircraft with realistic handling and unique strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Score-based Endless Survival</strong><br>Stay alive against smarter and deadlier enemies as your score climbs and global pressure increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Adaptive Enemy AI</strong><br>Opponents evolve: new aircraft generations, coordinated attacks, and ruthless tactics as you climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Nation vs Nation Global Ranking</strong><br>Your kills count toward your country \u2014 rise into the <strong>Top 5</strong> to unlock your national war-flag background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Smooth and responsive control</strong><br>Designed for keyboard and gamepad, with fast reaction and clean flight physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee9\ufe0f <strong>Hangar Customization</strong><br>Select aircraft, skins, and prepare for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>War-themed soundtrack</strong><br>Atmospheric ambient tracks and command-center style UI audio for maximum immersion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939710?t=1765052592","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939710?t=1765052592","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939710/dd384f40be8ad6374f1274b6c8d393fdae1d15e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765052592","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939710/dd384f40be